# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 7. Local-only junk kept on disk, never published (wave-6 cleanup, 2026-10-15).
#    These were tracked but are scratch: throwaway debug probes, run result
#    dumps, internal campaign bookkeeping, the audit corpus, and one-off
#    workflow scripts. Removed from the index with `git rm --cached`; they stay
#    on disk for local use. Tag `w6-pre-ignore-cleanup` restores the old state.
#    NOTE: this is a deny-by-default allowlist, so these rules sit AFTER the
#    `!` re-includes in section 4/5 and re-ignore what those re-included.

# 7a. Throwaway debug probes (hardcoded /usr/bin/google-chrome, 0 referrers).
/e2e/flows/debug-*.mjs

# 7b. Generated run-result dumps (regenerable evidence, not source).
/e2e/flows/*-result.json

